n-access article distributed under the terms of the Creative Commons Attribution-Noncommercial-Share Alike 3.0 Unported, which permits unrestricted use, distribution, and reproduction in any medium, provided the original work is properly cited.</license-p></license></permissions><abstract><p>Two case reports of adverse reactions to Zolpidem are described. In both cases, the reaction was to a dosage oflOmg occurring about 15 minutes after intake of the drug.</p></abstract><kwd-group><kwd>Zolpidem</kwd><kwd>adverse effects</kwd></kwd-group></article-meta></front></article>